# Multi-table JOINs - a1-a4 acceptance data.
# Golden values generated from the real sqlite3; ORDER BY makes output
# deterministic. NULL never matches in join conditions; LEFT JOIN
# pads unmatched rows with NULL; USING merges its columns.

